{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_RUNAI",
      "label": "Run:ai Prometheus (downstream)",
      "description": "Choose the Grafana Prometheus datasource connected to prometheus-operated.runai.svc.cluster.local:9090",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "9.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "id": null,
  "uid": "runai-gpu-poc-monitoring-status",
  "title": "Run:ai | GPU, Workload & Pod Status — POC",
  "description": "Downstream Run:ai monitoring dashboard with simulated GPUs; use RunAI-Prometheus, not upstream Thanos for raw DCGM series. Dashboard extends GPU and scrape monitoring with Kubernetes Pod phases (Running, Pending, Succeeded/Completed, Failed, Unknown) and optional native Run:ai workload metrics. Pod phases are not synonymous with Run:ai job lifecycle statuses.",
  "tags": [
    "runai",
    "gpu",
    "monitoring",
    "rke2",
    "poc"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "workload_namespace",
        "label": "Workload namespaces",
        "description": "Filters Pod phase panels to namespaces whose names begin runai-gpu-. Use the dropdown to choose individual namespaces.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": "prom-runai-2",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kube_pod_status_phase, namespace)",
          "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
        },
        "regex": "/^runai-gpu-.*/",
        "sort": 1,
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "runai-gpu-.*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Run:ai PoC — how to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Run:ai GPU & Workload Monitoring — downstream RKE2\n**Metrics pipeline:** Fake GPU Operator → DCGM Exporter → ServiceMonitor → **Run:ai Prometheus** → Grafana. **These GPU measurements are simulated, not physical hardware telemetry.**\n\nUse the **RunAI-Prometheus** data source (downstream). Panels labeled *optional* can display **No data** if their metrics are not emitted by your Run:ai chart or fake exporter. Upstream Thanos intentionally filters raw DCGM metrics through `writeRelabelConfigs`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Workload status — Kubernetes pods vs Run:ai workloads",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### GPU workload status overview\nThe six counters below count **Kubernetes Pods**, filtered to the selected `runai-gpu-*` workload namespaces. `Completed` corresponds to Pod phase **`Succeeded`**. These are **Pod phases**, not necessarily the logical Run:ai workload lifecycle statuses; a single workload may create more than one Pod. The Run:ai workload panel below uses the separate `runai_workload_count_per_type_per_phase_per_cluster` metric (if your cluster exposes it). **If a panel displays No data, first verify `kube_pod_status_phase` is present in the selected `prom-runai-2` data source; No data is not the same as zero.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total workload Pods",
      "description": "All Pods currently reported by kube-state-metrics in selected workload namespaces.",
      "datasource": "prom-runai-2",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": "prom-runai-2",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=~\"$workload_namespace\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
